I've designed a font for the X11 window system and a little bit of
code for nethack 2.3 which draws monsters and objects in that font.
There are nice glyphs for almost all of the characters in hack.
There's also a utility so you can edit the font if you want to change
some of the characters.  It takes a little getting used to, but you'll
never go back!  All available in xnethack.tar.Z on
whitechapel.media.mit.edu, 18.85.0.125, via anon ftp.  I've sent a
copy to Mike Stephenson, who seems to have sent out nethack 2.3, so
perhaps it will become available in that distribution as well...

